Let $a_1, a_2, \dots, a_n$ be a sequence of real numbers such that $a_1 = 1$ and for all integers $k \geq 2$,
\[ a_k = \left\{
\begin{array}{ll}
a_{k-1} + 2 & \text{if } k \text{ is even}, \\
a_{k-1} - 1 & \text{if } k \text{ is odd}.
\end{array}
\right. \]

Find the smallest positive integer $n$ such that $a_n = 2023$.

